<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Decapitate</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>decapitate corpse
</pre>
<p>Cuts the head off a corpse. A head is the proof of a kill: bring the head 
of a wanted criminal to the city guard Captain to collect the reward on 
it (see <a cmd='#'>Help Wanted</a>), or the head of a bounty target to the Hunter of the 
Bounty Hunters Guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Bounty</a>). If there was a reward on the 
corpse, it goes with the head.
</p><p>A head keeps for half an hour of real time; then the maggots get it. A 
corpse can lose its head only once, and some creatures have no head to 
cut. You can do it sitting.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wanted</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Bounty</a>
</pre>




</div>